00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:09.060
and it can feel lonely at times.

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.100
Hi there, Steve Kaufmann here.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:14.790
Today I'm going to talk about a subject
that doesn't come up very often.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.450
It's loneliness, loneliness
and language learning.

